      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "desktop-message-received",
      "description": "Default-light incoming and outgoing native bubble geometry, translated into passive HTML; tails share the body fill.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-messages\"><div class=\"ds-message-row\"><div class=\"ds-bubble ds-received\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 8 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 0 1 6 8 12Z\"/></svg>The desktop components are ready for a look.</div></div><div class=\"ds-message-row ds-outgoing\"><div class=\"ds-bubble ds-sent\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 8 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 0 7 6 0 12Z\"/></svg>Nice. How do the compact controls feel on the Mac?</div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-messages{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;padding:24px;background:#fafafa;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif}.ds-message-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;width:100%}.ds-outgoing{flex-direction:row-reverse}.ds-bubble{position:relative;max-width:78%;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:5px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}.ds-received{background:#eeeef0;color:#1a1a1c}.ds-sent{background:#95ec69;color:#000}.ds-bubble svg{position:absolute;top:9px;width:8px;height:12px}.ds-received svg{left:-6px;fill:#eeeef0}.ds-sent svg{right:-6px;fill:#95ec69}"
